  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Kazakhstan Partnership Strategic Communications Campaign&amp;#10;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is to position the EU as a partner of reference for Kazakhstan among selected target audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives (Outcomes) of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Increased positive perception towards the EU as a key partner supporting Kazakhstan&#xbf;s independence and reform pathway.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of the objectives and positive impacts of EU-Kazakhstan partnership and its added value, particularly through Global Gateway&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
